# Juno Desktop (Electron) — workspace-local ignores.
#
# The repo root already ignores this workspace's build output by explicit path,
# which is the convention here for self-contained sub-workspaces (see the same
# treatment of relay/ and runner/agent-core/ in /.gitignore):
#
#   native/desktop-electron/node_modules
#   native/desktop-electron/out
#   native/desktop-electron/dist
#   native/desktop-electron/coverage
#   native/desktop-electron/test-results
#   native/desktop-electron/playwright-report
#
# The root remains canonical for those. They are restated below scoped to this
# directory so that build output cannot start appearing in `git status` if the
# root list is ever reorganised — a restatement of an identical, path-scoped
# rule, which cannot change behaviour for anything outside this directory.
#
# Everything under "Not covered at the root" is only here.

# --- Restated from the root, scoped to this workspace ---
node_modules/
out/
dist/
coverage/
test-results/
playwright-report/

# --- Not covered at the root ---

# Vite's on-disk dependency-optimizer cache. Regenerated on demand; churns.
.vite/
.eslintcache

# `tsc --build` writes here (tsconfig.*.json outDir) and drops .tsbuildinfo.
*.tsbuildinfo

# The conventional suffix for a file that overrides a checked-in one on one
# machine only: electron-builder.local.yml, dev-app-update.local.yml.
*.local

# --- Signing and notarization material: never commit ---
#
# These are credentials, not configuration. A committed .p8 App Store Connect
# key or exported .p12 identity is a leaked signing credential — anyone holding
# it can ship software as this developer, and the fix is revocation plus a
# re-release, not a `git rm`. Apple credentials reach the build through the
# environment (APPLE_ID / APPLE_APP_SPECIFIC_PASSWORD / APPLE_TEAM_ID) or the
# login keychain; see scripts/notarize.cjs.
*.p12
*.pfx
*.cer
*.certSigningRequest
*.provisionprofile
*.mobileprovision
AuthKey_*.p8
*.p8

# electron-builder's own scratch space and the notarization receipts it leaves
# beside the artifacts.
.cache/electron-builder/
*.blockmap
